# beta4-truth.patch -- the release-truth.yaml flip for v1.0.0-beta.4, NOT YET APPLIED.
#
# Do not apply until v1.0.0-beta.4 has actually published: real kit SHA, build
# run id, Gate A run id, setup.exe SHA-256, and Authenticode status must all be
# known. Applying it before that would make docs/releases/release-truth.yaml --
# "the SOLE AUTHORED SOURCE for CivicCast release state" -- assert a release is
# current before it exists, which the file's own header rule forbids ("Flips to
# current ... only once an actual publish lands").
#
